# Native Settings, decision D3 (task 014 P2a): a page with no native widget yet (here User, the account info page)
# opens from the native host through the compat path in a development build (APPLAUNCH_DEV=1): the legacy page in
# the compat window with the toolbar. Its Esc returns to the native Settings on the same row; Esc on level 1 goes
# home. Review only, no golden.
title settings native compat path
review
sizes 480x320 800x480
env APPLAUNCH_SETTINGS_UI native
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home ZERO
launch Settings
key UP
key UP
key UP
shot settings_compat_row
key ENTER
shot settings_compat_page
key ESC
wait 300
shot settings_compat_back
header settings_compat_back Settings
key ESC
wait 300
shot settings_compat_home
